<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston has upgraded British Telecom shares following the weekend announcement of its $20 billion merger with America's MCI Communications.</p>
<p>CSFB said it had raised its recommendation on the basis of the conservative estimate of $2.5 billion in synergies over the first five years of operation, and on the expectation that the new company would realise double-digit earnings growth and some of the highest potential returns on investment in the industry.</p>
<p>Shares in BT were trading 33p higher at 384p in heavy volumes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
